SamenvattingStart as an Order Picker at Albert Heijn in Almere and, together with your colleagues, make sure that groceries are prepared on time. Would you like to work in a 3-shift system, have the opportunity to secure a permanent position and be part of a motivated team? Apply in less than 2 minutes. Good work!Over de functieAs an Order Picker, you will work in the warehouse, where you will collect products using a handheld scanner and prepare customer orders. Together with your motivated colleagues, you will make sure that everything runs smoothly.
Your responsibilities will also include:
- Collecting online orders using a handheld scanner;
- Checking the quality of the products;
- Managing and organizing stock;
- Scanning barcodes to match products with their locations.

You will work in a 3-shift system. The working hours are from 06:00 to 14:30, from 14:30 to 23:00 and from 23:00 to 06:00. Of course, you will receive additional shift allowances for this!
Over het bedrijfAlbert Heijn is one of the largest and best-known supermarket chains in the Netherlands. You will work at the fast-growing warehouse in Alsmere, together with motivated colleagues from different backgrounds. You will also be encouraged to develop your skills and get the best out of yourself.
Wat wij vragen- Your own accommodation in the Netherlands;
- At least 1 year of experience in this or a similar logistics position;
- You are willing to work in a 3-shift system and on weekends;
- You don't mind working in a cold environment;
- You speak basic English.

Of course, these requirements are essential for the Orderpicker position, but we are especially interested in you and your talents. Surprise us!
Wat wij bieden- Salary between €14.99 and €23.85 gross per hour, depending on the shift and experience;
- Shift allowances of up to 200%, including Sundays and public holidays;
- 8.33% holiday allowance;
